Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "If we fail to reclaim the dark magic, both I
and this world will be consumed in shadow.",
  "1.0.1.0" => "But Phantom Ganon threw us all over
the place! He's way too powerful!",
  "1.0.2.0" => "If we don't stop Phantom Ganon,
then the lightning will never cease.",
  "1.0.3.0" => "There is another way. The power of
the sages. It can protect us!",
  "1.0.4.0" => "Curse that shadow... He's using the power
of the magic to grow even stronger.",
  "1.0.5.0" => "That power. Hmm, I'd be jealous...but not
now! We must capture the Sage's Keeps!",
  "1.0.6.0" => "There's a big pattern inside the keep...
So that must be the Sage's Keep!",
  "1.0.7.0" => "We captured the keep, but the gates didn't
open. What gives?",
  "1.0.8.0" => "I believe that is Phantom Ganon's doing.
He is proving to be rather crafty indeed.",
  "1.0.9.0" => "Then we'll just have to capture
each and every Sage's Keep!",
  "1.0.10.0" => "That's two Sage's Keeps for us!
Come on, everyone! Keep it up!",
  "1.0.11.0" => "Don't forget to protect the keeps after you
take them. Losing them is bad news!",
  "1.0.12.0" => "What is that...? The way is blocked, and
we can't advance to the Sage's Keep!",
  "1.0.13.0" => "Hm? Oh, do you see that switch? Maybe
something will happen if we press it.",
  "1.0.14.0" => "Good work! We can continue our advance!",
  "1.0.15.0" => "We must hurry to the Sage's Keeps.
Perhaps that switch will help...",
  "1.0.16.0" => "Gracious! Did anyone else witness
those trees grow so quickly?",
  "1.0.17.0" => "Connecting these paths benefits the enemy,
too. Don't let them call for reinforcments!",
  "1.0.18.0" => "We've failed to stop the enemy messenger.
Now there are even more enemies than before!",
  "1.0.19.0" => "I believe we've halted the enemy's plans
for further troop replenishment.",
  "1.0.20.0" => "The Sage's Keeps are weakening Phantom
Ganon! Your plan worked somehow!",
  "1.0.21.0" => "Hold on. Cia! We'll be right there!",
  "1.0.22.0" => "Great, the monsters are getting stronger.
Let's give Cia a hand already!",
  "1.0.23.0" => "Careful! Connecting those paths might give
our enemies a way to steal our base or keeps!",
  "1.0.24.0" => "Plus, there are a lot of monsters in the
nearby keeps!",
  "1.0.25.0" => "If we connect the paths, it might give the
enemy an advance to steal our base or keeps!",
  "1.0.26.0" => "There are many enemies at the nearby
keeps as well.",
  "1.0.27.0" => "Two creatures came out?!",
  "1.0.28.0" => "They'll target the Sage's Keeps again. If
we lose those, we'll see more lightning!",
  "1.0.29.0" => "We must not let our foes claim the
Sage's Keeps!",
  "1.0.30.0" => "No... We cannot protect the Sage's Keeps
any longer!",
  "1.0.31.0" => "If we lose the Sage's Keeps, then the 
lightning starts striking all over again!",
  "1.0.32.0" => "We'll lose the Sage's Keeps if we do nothing!",
  "1.0.33.0" => "We're going to have to deal with the
lightning again if the Sage's Keeps fall!",
  "1.0.34.0" => "This is bad. The Sage's Keeps won't
hold much longer!",
  "1.0.35.0" => "Losing the Sage's Keeps means we'll have
to deal with the lightning again! No!",
  "1.0.36.0" => "What should we do? The Sage's Keeps
are going to be taken!",
  "1.0.37.0" => "We have to move fast! Cia can't win
this fight on her own!",
  "1.0.38.0" => "The monsters started marching! We need to
go help Cia now, or it'll be too late!",
  "1.0.39.0" => "No... If only I had access to my
full powers...",
  "1.0.40.0" => "You've... You've saved me.
Thank you.",
  "1.0.41.0" => "That behemoth finally went down!",
  "1.0.42.0" => "This is bad. Both our base and the Sage's
Keeps are in danger. Beat back those baddies!",
  "1.0.43.0" => "We must work together to stop the enemies.
Protect our base and the Sage's Keeps!",
  "1.0.44.0" => "All the paths are open. Come on!
Let's head to Cia!",
  "1.0.45.0" => "No! We must reclaim the Sage's Keeps!
It's the only way to stop the lightning!",
  "1.0.46.0" => "The enemy's reserves are diminished!
Reclaim the Sage's Keeps! Now!",
  "1.0.47.0" => "The new rift! He caused it, but how?
Where is his magic power coming from...?",
  "1.0.48.0" => "He stole it from me, and I'm not in
a very forgiving mood.",
  "1.0.49.0" => "Everyone, lend your power to Cia!",
  "1.0.50.0" => "You got it!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "Right away!",
  "1.0.52.0" => "You can have our power, too!",
  "1.0.53.0" => "Alone, we stand no hope. But together?
Yes! We must strike as a team!",
  "1.0.54.0" => "Everyone's here! Now, Cia!
Attack!",
  "1.0.55.0" => "Here we go, lovelies!",
  "1.0.56.0" => "Urgh... I'm spent from that little show of
authority. It's up to the rest of you now.",
  "1.0.57.0" => "Don't worry. Leave it to us!
We'll win for sure!",
  "1.0.58.0" => "Let's decide this thing once and for all!
Attack him as best you can!",
  "1.0.59.0" => "Our foe may be fierce and fearsome,
but do not be afraid!",
  "1.0.60.0" => "Let's go, everyone! One last push!",
  "1.0.61.0" => "I haven't seen an attack like this.
Everyone, don't get careless!",
  "1.0.62.0" => "Every opponent, no matter how strong, has
a weakness. We must find our opportunity!",
  "1.0.63.0" => "We'll be fine if we all work together.
That's how battles are won!",
  "1.0.64.0" => "Just a little more, and then Cia's strength
will be returned!",
  "1.0.65.0" => "Right, that's why we HAVE to win
this fight!",
  "1.0.66.0" => "Forgive me... I was...no help...",
  "1.0.67.0" => "If we capture the Sage's Keeps, then
their light will weaken our foe.",
  "1.0.68.0" => "We'll take care of the enemies on top.
Connect the path when we're done!",
  "1.0.69.0" => "I will deal with the enemies up above.
Once I've finished, connect the paths.",
  "1.0.70.0" => "Lana, gather the others! We
need a lot of power for this!",
  "1.0.71.0" => "Don't get in our way!
We need to get to Cia!",
  "1.0.72.0" => "Out of my way! Cia needs me!",
  "1.0.73.0" => "Outta my way! I need to get
to this Cia person already!",
  "1.0.74.0" => "Be gone! My duty lies with Cia's
rescue, not with fighting you!",
  "1.0.75.0" => "I can see a big pattern inside the keep.
Does that mean it's a Sage's Keep?",
  "1.0.76.0" => "I see a pattern inside... So that must
be the Sage's Keep.",
  "1.0.77.0" => "There's a pattern inside the keep. So
that must be the Sage's Keep.",
  "1.0.78.0" => "We won't be able to reach Cia unless we
hit those switches and connect the paths.",
  "1.0.79.0" => "The only way to Cia is by hitting those
switches and connecting the paths!",
  "1.0.80.0" => "Our base! What a dreary way for
it all to end...",
  "1.0.81.0" => "Everyone's having a hard time
grouping up...",
  "1.0.82.0" => "Strike back without fear if he attacks!
...I am sure we have a shot at victory!",
  "1.0.83.0" => "Without Cia, we won't be able to
contain the dark magic...",
  "1.0.84.0" => "Only one more Sage's Keep to go! Then
we need to get to Cia immediately!",
  "1.0.85.0" => "Ha! The statues just disappeared when
they were struck by the light! How bizarre.",
  "1.0.86.0" => "I should use the Hookshot now to get to
higher ground.",
  "1.0.87.0" => "Right, lemme use the Hookshot real quick
to fly up there.",
  "1.0.88.0" => "Can someone think of a way to open
the gate that's in this corridor?",
  "1.0.89.0" => "There's a gate in the way here, but...
can we do something about that?",
  "1.0.90.0" => "If we could just take care of this gate,
meeting up would be a piece of cake!",
  "1.0.91.0" => "Opening this gate would help bring us
together.",
  "1.0.92.0" => "We did it! The gate opened!",
  "1.0.93.0" => "Done! The gate opened!",
  "1.0.94.0" => "Yes! The gate opened!",
  "1.0.95.0" => "Splendid! We opened the gate!",
  "1.0.96.0" => "That Phantom Ganon... He must be
building his magic power as we speak.",
  "1.0.97.0" => "If we beat the monsters and strengthen
the power of light, he'll leave his base.",
  "1.0.98.0" => "Let's all do our part to defeat monsters
and protect Cia!",
  "1.0.99.0" => "Watch out! Phantom Ganon! He's coming
out!",
  "13.0.0.0" => "Look, Link! Is that a switch over there?",
  "13.0.1.0" => "We need to get to the Sage's Keep. Maybe
we can use the switch there to go up.",
  "13.0.2.0" => "Amazing! The tree grew really big in an
instant!",
  "13.0.3.0" => "If we connect paths, enemies can cross,
too. Don't let them call reinforcements!",
  "13.0.4.0" => "Looks like we didn't make it in time...
More enemies now at the Sage's Keeps...",
  "13.0.5.0" => "Now we don't have to worry about
enemy forces increasing!",
  "13.0.6.0" => "He's strengthening those monsters again.
Cia's in trouble unless we do something!",
  "13.0.7.0" => "But if we join paths now, enemies up top
might attack the base or Sage's Keeps.",
  "13.0.8.0" => "There are lots of enemies at the nearby
keeps, too!",
  "13.0.9.0" => "But if we join paths now, enemies up top
might attack the base or Sage's Keeps.",
  "13.0.10.0" => "Lots of enemies at the nearby keeps too!",
  "13.0.11.0" => "Two enormous creatures just came out!",
  "13.0.12.0" => "If they take the keeps, the lightning will
start again!",
  "13.0.13.0" => "What should we do? If we do nothing,
they'll take the keeps!",
  "13.0.14.0" => "If they take our keeps, the lightning will
start again!",
  "13.0.15.0" => "What should we do?! If we don't act,
we'll lose the keeps!",
  "13.0.16.0" => "The lightning will start again if they
take the keeps!",
  "13.0.17.0" => "We have to do something, or we'll lose
the keeps!",
  "13.0.18.0" => "If they take the Sage's Keeps, the
lightning will start again!",
  "13.0.19.0" => "Hrm... Can't protect the Sage's Keeps
any longer!",
  "13.0.20.0" => "If the lightning starts up again, they'll
take the Sage's Keeps!",
  "13.0.21.0" => "They'll take the Sage's Keeps if we don't
do something!",
  "13.0.22.0" => "If we let them take the Sage's Keeps,
the lightning will fall!",
  "13.0.23.0" => "This is not good... The Sage's Keeps
won't hold up!",
  "13.0.24.0" => "We have to beat them quickly! Cia can't
do it on her own!",
  "13.0.25.0" => "The monsters are moving! We need to
rescue Cia before it's too late!",
  "13.0.26.0" => "All right! We beat a huge monster!",
  "13.0.27.0" => "There's a huge pattern on the keep...
That must be a Sage's Keep!",
  "13.0.28.0" => "Some sort of huge design... That must
be the Sage's Keep.",
  "13.0.29.0" => "There's a pattern on the keep. That
must be the Sage's Keep!",
  "13.0.30.0" => "There's a big pattern on the keep! So
that's the Sage's Keep?",
  "13.0.31.0" => "There's a huge pattern on the keep. So
is that the Sage's Keep?",
  "13.0.32.0" => "There's a giant pattern on the keep! Is
that the Sage's Keep?",
  "13.0.33.0" => "I guess we can't get to Cia unless we
use the switches to connect the paths.",
  "13.0.34.0" => "So, we can't get to Cia unless we use
the switches to connect the paths.",
  "13.0.35.0" => "I guess it would be hard for everyone to
get together now...",
  "13.0.36.0" => "Link will beat the enemies up top first.
After that, connect the paths, Tetra!",
  "13.0.37.0" => "Link will beat the enemies up top first.
After that, connect the paths!",
  "13.0.38.0" => "The statues disappeared when they were
struck by light!",
  "13.0.39.0" => "We can't get to Cia unless we use the
switches and connect the paths.",
  "13.0.40.0" => "Looks like it's difficult for everyone to
get together now...",
  "13.0.41.0" => "Seems difficult for everyone to get
together now...",
  "13.0.42.0" => "He's strengthening his monsters! Cia's
in trouble if we don't do something!",
  "13.0.43.0" => "It looks like I can't get to Cia unless I
use the switches to connect the paths.",
  "13.0.44.0" => "It seems we can't get to Cia unless we
use the switches to connect the paths.",
  "13.0.45.0" => "But if we join paths, the base and the
keep could be attacked from above.",
  "13.0.46.0" => "But if we join paths, the base and the
keep could be threatened from above.",
  "13.0.47.0" => "The monsters are moving! I have to go
help Cia before it's too late!",
  "13.0.48.0" => "The monsters are moving, are they?!
We must help Cia before it's too late!",
  "13.0.49.0" => "There's a gate on this path... Can we
open it somehow?",
  "13.0.50.0" => "It would be a lot easier to get together
if we could open up the gate.",
  "13.0.51.0" => "Opening the gate on this path would
make it easier for us to meet up...",
  "13.0.52.0" => "There's a gate on this path. Is there any way
to open it?",
  "13.0.53.0" => "There's a gate on this path. Is there any way
to open it?",
  "13.0.54.0" => "There's a gate on this path. Is there any way
to open it?",
  "13.0.55.0" => "Done! Gate's open!",
  "13.0.56.0" => "Yes! The gate opened!",
  "13.0.57.0" => "Well done! The gate is no longer an
obstacle.",
  "13.0.58.0" => "We did it! The gate opened!",
  "13.0.59.0" => "We did it! The gate opened!",
  "13.0.60.0" => "We did it! The gate opened!",
  "13.0.61.0" => "I need to get to Cia! Just stay out of
my way!",
  "13.0.62.0" => "It'd be nice if you got out of the way.
I'm going over to where Cia is.",
  "13.0.63.0" => "I must quickly get to where Cia is. You
must get out of my way.",
  "13.0.64.0" => "Out of our way! We're going to Cia!",
  "13.0.65.0" => "Get out of our way! We're trying to get
to Cia!",
  "13.0.66.0" => "Out of our way! We're heading to Cia!
",
  "13.0.67.0" => "Now we'll just use the Hookshot to get
to higher ground!",
}